OL,6,     FShopping from Home.
OL,7,G0900 Inside the Ambulance
OL,8,     FCrews are sent to a 70-year-old
OL,9,     Fwith breathing problems who
OL,10,     Frequires immediate surgery. Plus,
OL,11,     Fparamedics are called to treat a
OL,12,     Fseriously ill man who is showing
OL,13,     Fsigns of sepsis.
OL,14,G0930 Inside the Ambulance
OL,15,     FParamedics help a man suffering
OL,16,     Ffrom anxiety who discovered he
OL,17,     Fmight have been exposed to HIV.
OL,18,     FMeanwhile, crews attend to a man
OL,19,     Ffound unconscious in the stairwell
OL,20,     Fof a block of flats.
